"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "elder",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "elder",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela <b>elda</b> em i wanpela man o meri we i gat <a href=\"#t8\">atoriti</a> insait long komyuniti. Insait long Olpela Tesatmen, wanpela elda em i wanpela het bilong wanpela famili o wanpela lain famili. Wanpela grup elda em ol i save bung wantaim long mekim ol disisen long ol samting insait long komyuniti.</p><p>Insait long Nupela Testamen, ol elda em ol manmeri insait long <a href=\"#t24\">sios</a> husat i gat atoriti. Ol <b>aposel</b>, kain olsem Pol, i save makim ol elda. Ol aposel i bin makim ol manmeri we ol narapela manmeri i rispektim insait long sios komyuniti long kamap olsem ol elda. Wanpela elda em i nid long wanbel long sevim ol narapela manmeri na em i mas no gat rong o asua.</p><p><b>Taim yu trensletim ol elda, yu mas lukaut long ol dispela samting:</b></p><p>Taim yu trensletim dispela wod, yu mas lukaut olsem yu no yusim wod we i min olsem &quot;lapun manmeri.&quot; Wanpela elda em i no wanpela lapun man o meri olgeta taim, na tu em i no yangpela man o meri tru.</p>",
