{
"content_id": "tpi-t209-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "el-elyon",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "elelyon",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><b>El-Elion</b> em i wanpela nem we ol manmeri i save yusim long <a href=\"#t189\">God</a>. El-Elion em i min olsem &quot;God antap tru.&quot; Taim ol manmeri i yusim dispela nem long God, em i mekim ol i tingim olsem God em i pawaful tru. Dispela nem em i min olsem i no gat wanpela husat i moa impoten, o gat moa <a href=\"#t8\">atoriti</a>, o i gat moa pawa long God.  Planti taim ol manmeri i save yusim dispela nem bilong God insait long Buk Song, tasol ol i save yusim tu insait long ol narapela buk long Olpela Testamen.</p><p>Dispela wod &quot;el&quot; em i minim God, olsem na yumi save painim ol narapela nem bilong God insait long Baibel we i stap wantaim dispela wod &quot;el.&quot; Wanwan bilong ol dispela nem i tokim yumi wanpela impoten samting long God.</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
"start_ref": "01014017",
"start_ref_usfm": "GEN 14:17",
"end_ref": "01014024",
"end_ref_usfm": "GEN 14:24"
},
{
"start_ref": "04024014",
"start_ref_usfm": "NUM 24:14",
"end_ref": "04024019",
"end_ref_usfm": "NUM 24:19"
},
