{
"content_id": "tpi-t176-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "evangelist",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "evangelist",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela <b>evanjelis</b> em i wanpela man o meri husat i save autim <a href=\"#t60\">gospel</a>, o gutnius long Jesus. Dispela gospel em i gut nius olsem Jisas i bin stap long dispela graun, Jisas i bin dai long kisim bek yumi long panismen bilong <b>ol sin</b>bilong yumi, God i bin kirapim bek Jisas long dai, na Jisas i salim <b>Spirit bilong God</b> long givim pawa long ol folowa bilong em, dispela em ol manmeri we i bihainim bilong em. Sapos yumi bilipim dispela gut nius, yumi kamap pren wantaim God oltaim, na God i givim yumi nupela laip wantaim em, stat nau na i bai stap oltaim. Maski yumi olgeta biliva i ken mekim wok bilong serim gut nius, God i save givim sampela manmeri spesen gift long mekim wok bilong wanpela evanjelis bilong sios.</p>",
