{
"content_id": "tpi-t187-v1",
"reference_id": 0,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "evil",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "evil",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><b>Ivel o pasin nogut</b> em i oposit bilong gutpela.</p><p>Wanpela man o meri husat i ivel em i save laik long mekim nogut samting we i bagarapim ol narapela manmeri. Taim ol manmeri i stop long harim tok bilong God, ol i stat long mekim ol ivel eksen.</p><p>Bikos ol manmeri i save sakim tok bilong God tumas, Baibel i tisim yumi olsem ol hat bilong yumi i kamap ivel. Na yumi no laik long mekim ol gutpela samting, yumi laik long mekim ol nogut samting. Planti problem tru insait long wol olsem woa, nogat tru mani o kaikai na ol wansait pasin i kamap bikos long dispela ivel insait long ol hat bilong ol manmeri. Sik na dai tu em ol i kamap bikos long ivel.</p><p>God i save heitim ivel. God tasol i ken bagarapim ivel, bikos God em i gutpela olgeta. Taim God bai mekim <a href=\"#t157\">kingdom</a> i stap oltaim, em bai bagarapim ivel oltaim. No gat wanpela samting we i ivel bai go insait long kingdom bilong God. Inap long dispela taim i kamap, God i wok long larim ivel long kamap. Tasol God i gat moa pawa winim olgeta ivel.</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
"start_ref": "01002004",
"start_ref_usfm": "GEN 2:4",
"end_ref": "01002025",
"end_ref_usfm": "GEN 2:25"
},
{
"start_ref": "01008020",
